description:
## Bug

`lichen/subsys/lichen/link/include/lichen/link.h` changed the declaration:

```c
int lichen_tdma_init(struct lichen_tdma_ctx *_Nonnull tdma, const struct lichen_link_ctx *_Nonnull ctx);
```

But the implementation in `lichen/subsys/lichen/link/link_ctx.c:586` still has:

```c
int lichen_tdma_init(struct lichen_tdma_slot *_Nonnull s)
{
    if (s == NULL) return -EINVAL;
    s->id = 0;
    s->assigned = 0;
    s->next = 0;
    return 0;
}
```

The declaration was changed to match the documented init ordering in AGENTS.md but the implementation was not updated. This will not compile.

Also, the GPL license applies to code; CC-BY-4.0 applies to docs/specs only.
